C for about $5.30. That's worse, and your Base wallet would end up with no ETH for fees.\n- **Timing:** moving the ETH takes about 60 seconds and the swap takes about 2 seconds.\n- **Quote expiry:** the quotes are valid for 300 seconds. If they expire before you approve, I'll get new ones.\n\nApprove, reject or set a cost cap."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_9"},"id":"toolu_01TaVFpLe6EygLLWVGHBztpB"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_10\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01TaVFpLe6EygLLWVGHBztpB","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_10"},"id":"toolu_01BJaV1uRWPS5mmur5qSrAK9"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"pending\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01BJaV1uRWPS5mmur5qSrAK9","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":33,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_10"},"id":"toolu_01GTDmQATgCh2VVs2dgfUQXL"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":34,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"pending\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01GTDmQATgCh2VVs2dgfUQXL","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":35,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_10"},"id":"toolu_01YB3ySKK4NErARGA663fcZM"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":36,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"pending\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01YB3ySKK4NErARGA663fcZM","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError